  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/02/IMG_3589.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>La bebeteca de la biblioteca infantil de Onda ha sido muy especial este mi&eacute;rcoles, pues ni&ntilde;os y ni&ntilde;as, y tambi&eacute;n madres y alg&uacute;n abuelo o padre y alguna abuela, se han disfrazado para celebrar la semana de carnaval.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bebetecacarnestoltes/img_3569.jpg\" alt=\"img_3569\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bebetecacarnestoltes/img_3571.jpg\" alt=\"img_3571\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bebetecacarnestoltes/img_3573.jpg\" alt=\"img_3573\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bebetecacarnestoltes/img_3574.jpg\" alt=\"img_3574\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bebetecacarnestoltes/img_3575.jpg\" alt=\"img_3575\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bebetecacarnestoltes/img_3577.jpg\" alt=\"img_3577\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bebetecacarnestoltes/img_3579.jpg\" alt=\"img_3579\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bebetecacarnestoltes/img_3580.jpg\" alt=\"img_3580\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bebetecacarnestoltes/img_3581.jpg\" alt=\"img_3581\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bebetecacarnestoltes/img_3582